   "date": "2017-08-02T20:42:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: [shinyapps-users] RxODE error",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not familiar with that package, but RTools is a windows specific tool chain for compiling native code. Shinyapps.io runs on Linux, where the GCC compiler should be available.<div><br></div><div>Have you checked the logs for additional errors that might clue us in on what exactly is going on?</div><div><br></div><div>-Andy</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
