mpose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2f5496\"> </span></a></p><span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> Andy Kipp [mailto:<a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>an...@rstudio.com</a>] <br><b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, 2 August 2017 22:42<br><b>To:</b> Tom &lt;<a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>sout...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360701949000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MK6Lh4_HtA0QaK_j7ePM8\">shinyapps.io</a> Users &lt;<a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>shinyapps-users@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Re: [shinyapps-users] RxODE error</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I&#39;m not familiar with that package, but RTools is a windows specific tool chain for compiling native code. Shinyapps.io runs on Linux, where the GCC compiler should be available.</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Have you checked the logs for additional errors that might clue us in on what exactly is going on?</p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-Andy</p></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
